{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "mylgv0wk7emeyxbi", "title": "152.Dify实现业务单据自动核对", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"kQfmM\" id=\"kQfmM\"><span data-lake-id=\"u115e38b9\" id=\"u115e38b9\">课程内容</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u985e1aff\" id=\"u985e1aff\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub910cd77\" id=\"ub910cd77\">我们在实际工作中发现OCR识别的发票准确性要求比较高。基于多模态大模型OCR识别这块可能会遇到对票面信息识别不准的问题，这样会财务报销就会产生很大的问题。基于以上的问题我们来实现一个单据比对工作流。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucab0e60f\" id=\"ucab0e60f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc0f1d9de\" id=\"uc0f1d9de\">下面我们首先介绍一下整体功能。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u247bf808\" id=\"u247bf808\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235414201-0c094be1-f1a3-4288-9f54-17f7613e32a8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u45acbcf2-7ee3-4899-ba8e-7a787ea7b7e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2563%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1106%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eff1f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf71b008b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u339b6fce\" id=\"u339b6fce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36bafc57\" id=\"u36bafc57\">这里面主要功能：用户上传一张发票图片，发票会经过文档提取器。文档提取器提取用户上传的发票传递给2个llm多模态模型，两个多模态模型是实现发票票面信息的提取功能。然后将提取的发票票面信息发送给第三个基于llm文本的大模型，它充当模型裁判功能。主要的功能是将2个模型输出的JSON格式的数据比对，比对的结果输出给客户。从而实现发票识别比对判断功能。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaeb2d4ea\" id=\"uaeb2d4ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud7649f43\" id=\"ud7649f43\">实现的效果如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1074bf07\" id=\"u1074bf07\"><span data-lake-id=\"u416f6a3b\" id=\"u416f6a3b\"> 数据有差异的效果：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud125e66b\" id=\"ud125e66b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235414183-ea3cc8ec-6454-49a0-93b5-ab5baf02a4a8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud9b51ad3-3997-4f37-a365-d992e195fc4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A903%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1410%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2357966b%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2642f170%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u33f81356\" id=\"u33f81356\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf4ad670\" id=\"ucf4ad670\"> 数据无差异效果：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4c2aa468\" id=\"u4c2aa468\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235414174-67387b01-9002-4e9d-b5b1-52ec39673203.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2c14e121-1462-4d9e-b8ea-27d95d1b8a8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A821%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1369%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f6f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua5173985%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0d468381\" id=\"u0d468381\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67ac7442\" id=\"u67ac7442\">下面我们重点介绍一下这个工作流是如何实现的。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"05b85f2e\" id=\"05b85f2e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u42e5b889\" id=\"u42e5b889\">创建工作流或者chatflow</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u77814860\" id=\"u77814860\"><span data-lake-id=\"u246fc510\" id=\"u246fc510\">接着来到Dify中按下图顺序依次点击并点击创建(注：chatflow和工作流配置基本差不多，下面我们就以chatflow讲解)</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf08be22d\" id=\"uf08be22d\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238856691-a8676dd4-8df1-4f92-b9a7-b460c67d4a13.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7e2ec949-c58e-4572-9954-de0b51f96d9%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubd49efa0-0ad2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1276%2C%22height%22%3A623%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A250655%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1914%2C%22originHeight%22%3A934%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23bebfb9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue3bc7cb4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"a3e3b883\" id=\"a3e3b883\"><span data-lake-id=\"u547f0646\" id=\"u547f0646\">开始</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u9579cb85\" id=\"u9579cb85\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc8f0c6c\" id=\"ucc8f0c6c\"> 开始节点点开后我们需要添加一个文件上传输入参数。点击开始节点输入字段，点击右边的“+”</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u56baf643\" id=\"u56baf643\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua34e6ed0\" id=\"ua34e6ed0\"> 我们选择单个文件，输入变量名称、支持的文件类型我们这里就选择图片。其他都可以默认，输入完成后，点击保存按钮</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6d4a2c86\" id=\"u6d4a2c86\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235414249-cdbd9c2a-d987-40fd-a86c-9eb7be5da7a0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8f9b6710-5810-4900-a05d-81df4ec366a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A974%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1539%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23aeb1a4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uddf8146a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"udb9ea9cb\" id=\"udb9ea9cb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae7b8d5d\" id=\"uae7b8d5d\">以上步骤完成开始节点设置。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u47e025d8\" id=\"u47e025d8\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238871931-682823b1-67c5-4233-9770-e1b37dcea14b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u09056ade-0681-48be-9b29-9481e4577bc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubd49efa0-0ad2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1240.6666666666667%2C%22height%22%3A613%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A279597%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1861%2C%22originHeight%22%3A919%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e3eaee%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9b1aae8e%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"d075b9b9\" id=\"d075b9b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf9c2fe50\" id=\"uf9c2fe50\">文档提取器</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u941e5467\" id=\"u941e5467\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67dcd9df\" id=\"u67dcd9df\"> 接下来我们在工作流画布中，选择文档提取器和开始节点连接，去掉llm和开始节点连接</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1efebcfd\" id=\"u1efebcfd\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235416219-c9252b15-b3c1-44c1-a7dd-984616a7bdeb.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u279343aa-434f-4853-b88a-b2fcb9bcf9a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1879%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1423%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c5e0dd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ubf8fce8b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3aca99cd\" id=\"u3aca99cd\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235416562-3b0a7467-d124-4cc2-b957-9bd1438dab50.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5b7d5053-5645-454b-8555-31cc0ef74e7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2842%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1410%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d0e5de%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udc3e55d1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u70183f3d\" id=\"u70183f3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a70eea9\" id=\"u0a70eea9\"> 我们在文档提取器，输入变量中选中 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf61e6d89\" id=\"uf61e6d89\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf367ce9c\" id=\"uf367ce9c\">sys.files</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf1b8d1ad\" id=\"uf1b8d1ad\"> 变量</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uea896591\" id=\"uea896591\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750238893387-5b305d30-9f67-41bb-badc-c39f25c72bd5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u37998362-8b5c-4208-a115-1883ed0740d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubd49efa0-0ad2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1248.6666666666667%2C%22height%22%3A577%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A211269%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1873%2C%22originHeight%22%3A865%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23aad3bf%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u921661fe%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"7b567176\" id=\"7b567176\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b5024fd\" id=\"u2b5024fd\">llm(多模态发票识别)</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u603b8692\" id=\"u603b8692\"><span data-lake-id=\"u334dc63e\" id=\"u334dc63e\">接下来我们将文档提取器的连接线和llm大语言模型连接。然后按照以下几个步骤设置</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8e148b8f\" id=\"u8e148b8f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u277d15a9\" id=\"u277d15a9\"> 1.模型选择，模型我们在模型下拉列表中选择自定义OpenAI-API-compatible Qwen/Qwen2-VL-72B-Instruct模型；模型最大标记4096</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u857a92ac\" id=\"u857a92ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4d97130e\" id=\"u4d97130e\"> 2.上下文，这里设置开始节点file 属性值</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u52b05e31\" id=\"u52b05e31\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae8a79d1\" id=\"uae8a79d1\"> 3.SYSTEM 提示词 我们输入如下内容</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E8%AF%B7%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%96%E8%BF%99%E5%BC%A0%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E2%80%98%E5%8F%91%E7%A5%A8%E5%8F%B7%E7%A0%81%E2%80%99%E3%80%81'%E5%BC%80%E7%A5%A8%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%E2%80%99%E3%80%81'%E2%80%98%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%91%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E2%80%99%E3%80%81%E2%80%98%E5%A7%8B%E5%8F%91%E7%AB%99%E2%80%99%E3%80%81%E2%80%98%E7%BB%88%E7%82%B9%E7%AB%99%E2%80%99%E3%80%81%E2%80%98%E8%BD%A6%E6%AC%A1%E2%80%99%E3%80%81%E2%80%98%E7%A5%A8%E4%BB%B7%E2%80%99%E3%80%81%E2%80%98%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E8%AF%81%E5%8F%B7%E2%80%99%E3%80%81%E2%80%98%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%E2%80%99%E3%80%81%E2%80%98%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E5%AE%A2%E7%A5%A8%E5%8F%B7%E2%80%99%E3%80%81%E2%80%98%E8%B4%AD%E4%B9%B0%E6%96%B9%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%E2%80%99%E3%80%81%E2%80%98%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E4%BF%A1%E7%94%A8%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E2%80%99%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E4%BB%A5json%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o6cbI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8c9ab770\" id=\"u8c9ab770\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1faf3efd\" id=\"u1faf3efd\"> 4.视觉 点击右边按钮开启多模态</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub89876f6\" id=\"ub89876f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u56cb11da\" id=\"u56cb11da\"> 5 视觉输入变量 选择节点file</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua720a1e2\" id=\"ua720a1e2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b1dbc4e\" id=\"u1b1dbc4e\">files</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6a56ef20\" id=\"u6a56ef20\"> 变量</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf790f77b\" id=\"uf790f77b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u421b4c89\" id=\"u421b4c89\">以上完成llm模型的设置</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u381d9acd\" id=\"u381d9acd\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235417251-ac5668d3-5812-4f08-bc1f-256b30bb167d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u46f9fe36-159d-4b68-b808-eb766508e7a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A843%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1308%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ebe2c2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u7a4e60ba%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue9abfdee\" id=\"ue9abfdee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u553a4e3d\" id=\"u553a4e3d\">以上我们需要再设置第二个多模态发票模型来对上传的图片进行发票识别，操作和上面一样，这里就不重复讲解，区别在于我们需要选择另外一个多模态模型。这里我们选择了智普的glm-4v-plus 来实现</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub0204746\" id=\"ub0204746\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235417818-be6c9b85-0da4-4c04-8371-5027ce2d6803.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u00cf270f-5773-4350-ab5a-b4ccb8df285%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A837%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1300%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e1e3ce%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua9b02a4a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue60a9643\" id=\"ue60a9643\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a65b680\" id=\"u4a65b680\"> 主要需要注意的地方是 智普模型对用户输入的提示词需要有值作为输入参数，这里我们为了让工作流运行起来，我们填写“1”</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua2578fdf\" id=\"ua2578fdf\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235419451-da6512fe-2554-4630-b1c6-a39334bd2b3b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2eb1398f-d7a1-4d01-9767-13fa3df9202%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A847%2C%22originHeight%22%3A776%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23bed1d2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3fcf706d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub0704df8\" id=\"ub0704df8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uffcdb450\" id=\"uffcdb450\"> 配置好的2个多模态模型需要和上面文档提取器连接</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uae832d69\" id=\"uae832d69\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1750235419427-1bb66196-fd6e-4ef3-8e1e-1a9508ab002c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubb2967cd-c843-4a1c-8243-48f056456d5%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue32ec243-9005-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1383%2C%22originHeight%22%3A770%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eff1f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uad301efe%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"f444a8d8\" id=\"f444a8d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9d50171\" id=\"uc9d50171\">基于文本发票比对模型</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u0b000cb5\" id=\"u0b000cb5\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01238ee8\" id=\"u01238ee8\"> 接下来我们需要将2个多模态模型的输出结果和一个llm文本大语言模型进行连接。这个模型的作用主要是接收2个模型输出json值，对2个json值进行判断逐行比对判断是否一致。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubd4d39e8\" id=\"ubd4d39e8\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u785f62cd\" id=\"u785f62cd\"> 1.模型选择，模型我们在模型下拉列表中选择 deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V2.5模型；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3eed524d\" id=\"u3eed524d\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud39bfdcc\" id=\"ud39bfdcc\"> 2.上下文，这里可以不填写</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua3794697\" id=\"ua3794697\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6555226b\" id=